# tof_silent_api_takeoff_est_high.scn — API takeoff, ToF silent during the climb, hover-thrust estimate 28 % TOO HIGH
#                                       API 離陸の上昇中に ToF が出力停止、ホバー推力の見積もりが 28 % 高い
#
# Same chain as tof_silent_api_takeoff.scn (the 2026-11 accident through the Tello-style API) with
# `hover.thrust_corr 1.2` set at t = 0: the second failing case (main as of 2026-11-08: the craft keeps
# climbing, truth peak 120 m). Spec under test:
#  1. The climb is aborted and the blind descent is the velocity loop: truth peak below 1.0 m, touchdown
#     speed below 0.6 m/s, the motors stop on the floor.
#  2. The API answers "error takeoff aborted" and a second `takeoff` is refused up front.
#
# tof_silent_api_takeoff.scn（Tello 風 API を通した 2026-11 の事故）と同じ連鎖で、t = 0 に
# `hover.thrust_corr 1.2` を設定: 2 つ目の失敗例（main（2026-11-08 時点）では
# 上昇し続け、真値の最高 120 m）。検証する仕様:
#  1. 上昇は中止され、ToF なしの降下は速度ループ: 真値の最高は 1.0 m 未満、接地速度は 0.6 m/s 未満、モータは
#     床の上で止まる。
#  2. API は "error takeoff aborted" を返し、二つ目の `takeoff` は最初に拒否される。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/tof_silent_api_takeoff_est_high.scn --target vehicle --duration 16000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    param      hover.thrust_corr 1.2                                  # P: hover-thrust estimate 1.2 x mg = 0.435 N against the true 0.34 N (+28 %)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                          # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # C: takeoff -> POS_HOLD -> ARM -> auto-takeoff climb
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     800       50      # D: the climb runs (to 6.8 s)
   +    tof_silent 1                                                  # E: 6.8 s — ToF output stops
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50      # F: aborted climb -> LANDING -> motors stop
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # G: second takeoff while silent -> refused up front
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     2000      50      # H: nothing happens
